  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1554339869}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7af502cdc0995bd0daf61a8c1b8ef90a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueManager
  Dialogues:
  - lines:
    - O rosto na foto levemente rasgado ainda te incomoda.
    - "N\xE3o pela aus\xEAncia, mas pelo o que voc\xEA fez antes dele sumir."
    LineSprites:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 30c19795378f1144385156cbe6567913, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: e3ec40784bcad824ca069ffc2ea1aa8b, type: 3}
    RequiredMissionIndex: -1
    RequiredEmotion: 0
    RequiredHeldFish: 0
    RequiredDayIndex: 1
    IsExtra: 0
    CompletesMission: 0
    EmotionToGive: 3
    UnlocksMap: 0
    BedTime: 0
  - lines:
    - "Seu irm\xE3o estava rindo quando essa foto foi tirada."
    - "Voc\xEA tinha esquecido disso."
    - "N\xE3o da imagem."
    - Do som.
    - "Por alguns segundos\u2026  "
    - A culpa fica quieta.
    - "E s\xF3 sobra a boa mem\xF3ria."
    LineSprites: []
    RequiredMissionIndex: -1
    RequiredEmotion: 0
    RequiredHeldFish: 0
    RequiredDayIndex: 2
    IsExtra: 0
    CompletesMission: 0
    EmotionToGive: 1
    UnlocksMap: 0
    BedTime: 0
  DialogueText: {fileID: 95930983}
